Subject: [PATCH 24/27] perf(callgraph): reduce transient ambiguity index
 allocations

Derive unique names from the retained candidate lists and remove temporary
package/directory count maps without narrowing nodes or resolution.

Verified: exact-source M2 task validate and full callgraph race tests;
paired 4096/65536-node allocation benchmarks and semantic differential tests.
